        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Alignment Generate",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://flow.seekr.com/v1/flow/alignment/generate",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Deprecated. Generate IFT pairs for alignment.\n\nThin wrapper that attaches deprecation headers and delegates to the\nroute-independent service function. Callers should migrate to the\ndata-jobs router. The headers are attached to both the success response\nand any raised HTTPException so the signal survives 4xx responses (FastAPI\ndiscards a mutated Response when the handler raises)."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Cancel Alignment Job",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://flow.seekr.com/v1/flow/alignment/:alignment_job_id/cancel",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "alignment_job_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Deprecated. Cancel an alignment job.\n\nUse ``POST /v1/flow/data-jobs/{data_job_id}/cancel``."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Alignment Workflow Phase",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://flow.seekr.com/v1/flow/alignment/:alignment_job_id/workflow-phase",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "alignment_job_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Internal: the live Argo workflow phase for an alignment job.\n\nNot part of the public SDK. Lets the integration suite confirm a cancelled\njob's workflow actually terminated (the DB `cancelled` write alone doesn't\nprove the Argo stop landed). ``phase`` is None when the workflow was never\nstarted or no longer exists in Argo."
        },
